'''[[Kochi (India)|Kochi]]''' is a city in the [[India]]n state of [[Kerala]]. Kochi is located in the district of [[Ernakulam District|Ernakulam]]. Today, Kochi includes the mainland [[Ernakulam]] and the islands of [[Fort Kochi]], [[Mattancherry]], [[Willingdon Island]], [[Mulavukad]], [[Vallarpadam]], [[Mundamveli]], [[Kumbalangi]], [[Cherai]] and other outlying islands. For many centuries up to and during the [[British Raj]], the city of Kochi was the seat of the eponymous [[princely state]] &mdash; the [[Kingdom of Cochin]], which lay between 9.48° and 10.50° latitude and 76.5° and 76.58° E longitude.

